    },
    {
      "id": "C6KdB3VYk_epDhriavSwM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10176.025596990123,
      "y": 2450.801921225062,
      "width": 571.9992065429688,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bU2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 613264517,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 670467845,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776567365881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Generalmente se implementa usando **BFS en ambas direcciones**.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Generalmente se implementa usando **BFS en ambas direcciones**.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LlNOvXS_k1IrTpZV2vYMa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10228.825523747935,
      "y": 2480.801921225062,
      "width": 466.39935302734375,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bU3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1976896075,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1574770635,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776567365881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Es **completo** si el grafo es finito y reversible.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Es **completo** si el grafo es finito y reversible.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VeT55fLS0tg416fqSY-S3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10149.625633611216,
      "y": 2510.801921225062,
      "width": 624.7991333007812,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bU4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1167053797,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1274633829,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776567365881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Es **óptimo** si ambas búsquedas usan BFS y los costos son uniformes.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Es **óptimo** si ambas búsquedas usan BFS y los costos son uniformes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MK48mL4THkSJlyJZ1X8PU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10070.425743474498,
      "y": 2530.801921225062,
      "width": 783.1989135742188,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bU5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2062780651,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 295560811,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776567365881,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Requiere que el problema permita **búsqueda inversa** (es decir, que las aristas puedan\nrecorrerse en sentido contrario).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Requiere que el problema permita **búsqueda inversa** (es decir, que las aristas puedan recorrerse en sentido contrario).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xt3SNmlRUmjSS_wKIl02V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10523.1659915765,
      "y": 2403.910078267337,
      "width": 8.79998779296875,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
